{"id":"jahr","lemma":"Jahr","pos":"noun","rank":205,"glosses":["year (solar year, the time it takes the Earth to complete one orbit of the Sun)","year (time it takes for any astronomical object to directly orbit its star)","year (period between set dates that mark a year)"],"ipa":"/jaːr/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/07/De-Jahr.ogg/De-Jahr.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Jahres","plural":"Jahre"},"formAudio":{"Jahres":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Jahres.wav","Jahre":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Jahre.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie ist fünf Jahre alt.","en":"She is five years old.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755220","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"five (numerical value…"},null,{"g":"old"}]},{"text":"Ich war für ein Jahr weg.","en":"I was away for a year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756881","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"away"}]},{"text":"Mein Sohn ist zehn Jahre alt.","en":"My son is ten years old.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"son"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"ten"},null,{"g":"old"}]},{"text":"Ich gehe jedes Jahr.","en":"I go every year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/29052","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},null]},{"text":"Ich liebe diese Zeit des Jahres.","en":"I love this time of year.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null]}]}